{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "4e46b498b239b41ffd977de30f3d1f519b675508e0852dba0faca8fefde2f011", "ja": "友情～激重感情～", "zh": "友情～沉重情感～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f2e8bdc747d9d82bed6af5001ea4310350f438a82fc6317fc646cbe326766ef8", "ja": "奈緒の思いつきとは、亜利沙の推しの曲を覚\nえてカラオケで披露することだった。レベル\nの高さに苦心しつつ曲をマスターしたアイド\nル達が亜利沙の前で歌うと、亜利沙は色々な\n意味で感極まって号泣し、笑顔を取り戻す。", "zh": "奈绪的想法，是学会亚利沙推的曲子并在\n卡拉OK唱给她听。偶像们虽然因难度极高\n而大伤脑筋，但还是练好了歌曲。当她们\n在亚利沙面前唱响时，亚利沙百感交集地\n嚎啕大哭，重新找回了笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8507034cf54701805f3b651862f70d11f6451fcd193e6662124a9b11ad819e6a", "ja": "（お、さっそくやってるみたいだな、みんな。\nどんな調子だろうか）", "zh": "（哦，大家已经开始了啊。进行得怎么样了呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "9d6f53acaeb7403ada6c8373cfd73a14830fc031b4c3714e892b17ef82a4adbe", "ja": "ちゃうちゃう、ここのサビはふぁ～って感じやなくて\nもっと、ぐわ～！　っとくんねん！", "zh": "不对不对，这里的副歌不是“呼——”的感觉，而是要更“轰——！”地唱出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "ba46a62a77ca83135894cd362359d0d8bed571c85885b2fa316692dc3904b3f0", "ja": "あー、そうだよね。てかこの曲ほんと高度だよね？\nよく歌えるなぁ、あの子たち。", "zh": "啊——，确实是这样。话说回来，这首歌真的很难吧？\n那几个孩子居然能唱得这么好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "4fdc0e393f231a98eca46c8776c554028badcfc358c304c2d5ffb14f00fa16dc", "ja": "やっぱり亜利沙さんの推しって、\nすごい人たちなんだね……。", "zh": "亚利沙小姐推的人，\n果然都很厉害呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "e24240727f49cc6244367b601a7306ed2489b0ae77c2c2345a2785df3c98340c", "ja": "よっし！　もっかいやってみよー！", "zh": "好嘞！再来练一次吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ad860835ad6f8b44b81f2e94f2e8a123984d58635f43ed6da737224ce74011d8", "ja": "みんな、調子はどうだ？\n『スパーク☆めいでん』の曲、覚えられたか？", "zh": "大家，状态怎么样？\n《火花☆女仆》的歌都记住了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "f9878713917bb6b960e3954ca0d2a44844617d868a8a6a0e136c81abd8921e05", "ja": "あ、お兄ちゃん。曲はだいたい覚えたけど、\n詰めがまだまだって感じかな。", "zh": "啊，哥哥。歌曲大致都记住了，不过感觉还需要继续打磨。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "7e579851c797365c992b610a4451a3b8ec002d6d1ad9ef0c56ce48b7a6b2d6a7", "ja": "めっちゃ難しいんですよ～！\nあと、フリも覚えなあかんし。", "zh": "真的超难的啦～！\n而且舞蹈动作也得记住才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "ae6c160c860d953eadf7b39a47209347dfc784fabb706417502d2d1ed8578101", "ja": "しかもすっごいテクニカルだよねー！\nでも、亜利沙のためなら頑張れる！", "zh": "而且技术含量超高的吧——！\n不过，为了亚利沙，我能努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1010_p", "source_sha256": "cb17c666cc829161c73cb432978f22423cd6a07b79d503f4d4cbd2190c1f4910", "ja": "亜利沙には明日、駅前のカラオケに来るように\n連絡しておいたよ。あと1日しかないけど……。", "zh": "我已经联系过亚利沙，让她明天来车站前的卡拉OK了。虽然只剩1天了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "9ca75cdcbeb46225729ed200f4a8a36972ac8ef1fac016073f8551b3a5a5af73", "ja": "遅れてごめーん！　……{$P$}さん、\n大丈夫です、今から巻き返しますから！", "zh": "抱歉我迟到了——！……{$P$}先生，没关系，我现在就把进度追回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "60a416f936c49849364d9cb6381c6c909d22dd10acc392508d3af16d0109d3f6", "ja": "お兄ちゃん！　桃子たちだってプロなんだから。\nそんな心配そうな顔しないで！", "zh": "哥哥！桃子她们也是专业人士。\n别摆出那么担心的表情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a9c4fbab40c6ecd556a6896a33706f6c821baafabe281a5590bb7ea9f545dd62", "ja": "そうだったな。……うん、よろしくな！", "zh": "对哦。……嗯，拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1014_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "78a94cc47cd9c4181b5e30918e4e1184c33452592ffeb3367328284902236015", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん。カラオケ集合って\nどうして……ってあれ！？　みなさんも！？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生。为什么要把大家集合在\n卡拉OK……哎等等！？大家也都在！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "5e91bb72ded1d089c3c30cd1fac710dcd4fa8c17b1bb309e1d426da216412788", "ja": "おー、亜利沙！　よかった、来てくれて！", "zh": "哦——亚利沙！太好了，你也来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "e7b47a5f2ee23bcca6e9ae0e2ec951ca543ebbc095299914cf74e7fc0de9d886", "ja": "そ、それはもちろんなんですケド……\nあの、どうしてみなさんもここに？", "zh": "这、这个当然是没问题啦，只是……\n那个，为什么大家也都在这里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "dffbaf49900810b35554cc3349779f652c999584ea976ec201d1367b74fda8af", "ja": "説明は後で！　とりあえず見てて。\n桃子たち、すっごく頑張ったんだから。", "zh": "解释之后再说！总之先看着吧。桃子她们可是非常努力的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "2ef00248c75ef2f3768bd03e6e72df274643ef1fb4f4402f41b0c69870ecf372", "ja": "？　は、はい……。", "zh": "？好、好的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1020_p", "source_sha256": "5c31b68bee7262e86a53e286bd3193192edc7ebb960cf8e0e60657bc41e844b6", "ja": "（そうして奈緒たちは、びっくりするほど完成度の\n高い『スパーク☆めいでん』カバーを披露した！）", "zh": "（就这样，奈绪她们献上了完成度高得令人惊叹的《Spark☆Meiden》翻唱！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "1d25e44d14c4b991572c69c5c5a50d2b73dbaa6153f3ad6d5afe4a62d9c47371", "ja": "あ、あ、あ……。あ、あ……。", "zh": "啊、啊、啊……。啊、啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "a331edd3021fe1ce43ac5c8c791b73427ba703a214104964b4bc86313dca5fdf", "ja": "おっ、お……。……！　……！！", "zh": "哦、哦……。……！……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1023_037nao", "source_sha256": "2fd0b4f422f9dbbae883b662e1058f12d2ec32e5406ac75192e47951501c06ff", "ja": "亜利沙、どうやった？　本家には敵わんやろうけど、\n私らなりにベストは尽くしたつもりや。", "zh": "亚利沙，感觉怎么样？虽然可能比不上本家，但我们也尽力做到最好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1024_028ari", "source_sha256": "65af79ff7059165fa6dfa189f93048f822eb40a82c379ec27ed0eddeabb9a5a8", "ja": "さ、さ……。", "zh": "呃、呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1025_001har", "source_sha256": "43d51387f62cd4ada3448209923d4a75cd5c818e6b5c244311683655266c5a2c", "ja": "さ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1026_028ari", "source_sha256": "73869726184136e0dad8f58c9a2bb518362e3622f93bb6cd60771c9ce90bb4e7", "ja": "最高すぎますよぉ～～～～～！！！！", "zh": "太棒了吧这也～～～～～！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1027_028ari", "source_sha256": "4b8679517b53d7d66e1e68b92dc624235da389e89aaa6befc70472a0a0fd7f95", "ja": "フリも完璧だしなによりサビのぐわ～！\nってくるとことかっ！　765プロカバーとかっ！", "zh": "舞步也完美无缺，最重要的是副歌那段“轰——！”地冲过来的地方！还有765事务所翻唱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1028_028ari", "source_sha256": "a0462434c739d08a7e0fbf1d64f174d6ecd0a4943755917ebd02bf31440a959c", "ja": "役得ぅ！　役得すぎますっ！　な、奈緒ちゃん、\nみなさんっ！　ありがとうございますぅ～！！！", "zh": "公费追星！这也太公费追星了吧！奈、奈绪，\n还有大家！太感谢你们啦～！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1029_043nor", "source_sha256": "d50da29ac6529059fc6670079a129a83615c647dec7c1bdc99e07b32c5a663ab", "ja": "あはは、良かった！　亜利沙、気に入ってくれた\nみたいだね！　本当に好きなんだ？", "zh": "啊哈哈，太好了！看来亚利沙很喜欢呢！是真的很喜欢吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1030_028ari", "source_sha256": "f171dd0227b358e34005e205969c7120e4c389f80a3d9b356f9d7e6429b6a1c8", "ja": "違います。いえ違いませんけど！　\nずっと大好きですけど！　でもそれより……。", "zh": "不是。也不能说不是！我一直都超喜欢的！但比起这个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1031_028ari", "source_sha256": "de750a1e536c000c06c979842882cfea65760871b5c883f4453f0727725acb9a", "ja": "みなさんの……、心遣いが……\nううっ、ひぐっ、ぐすっ……。", "zh": "大家的心意……\n呜呜，呃呜，抽泣……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1032_037nao", "source_sha256": "cb57045089ef30271c7ba4675bf014321b4be3fbe541f9f08a131a68f2df4025", "ja": "わーっ！　泣くんかい！　\nああ、ちょ、ハンカチハンカチ……。", "zh": "哇——！怎么哭起来了啊！\n啊，等、手帕手帕……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1033_028ari", "source_sha256": "c68bc4bb11542757e96cf251df6898d8d27f120102c8d186274e8bedcb36e1ca", "ja": "ありがとう……。ありがとう……。", "zh": "谢谢……。谢谢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1034_001har", "source_sha256": "a069d117a07e945a56f020b0caebbae68b9e2d3cde8797b608b03ed774fa3ed2", "ja": "亜利沙ちゃん……。", "zh": "亚利沙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1035_028ari", "source_sha256": "7b9c10011fe910d1dc115e53590c158dc4f27cb411475d0b1821f8ef6ee523cd", "ja": "奈緒ちゃんは……みなさんは、いつもそうです。\nさりげなくて、優しくて。すごく、あったかい……。", "zh": "奈绪……大家一直都是这样。\n那么体贴，那么温柔。真的，好温暖……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1036_037nao", "source_sha256": "74353f5a30b1307d3375274a2a186e6702972b4bf3b355305a4e83aedcdc8ee5", "ja": "べ、別に、そんなたいそうなことしてへんて。\n仲間が落ち込んどったら、何かしたなるもんやん？", "zh": "别、别说得那么夸张啦，我也没做什么了不起的事。\n看到伙伴情绪低落，总会想做点什么嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1037_028ari", "source_sha256": "b62bb756788bba27b2c3069d08dd339bb1beaf6c44e8f42ca7f93e1c1220c265", "ja": "そういうとこですよー！\nびえぇぇぇぇ～～～んっ！！！！", "zh": "就是这种地方呀——！\n哇啊啊啊啊～～～～！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0367_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_05_1038_028ari", "source_sha256": "45c7a7da97d3484e423bb7e9b23b1c89887e83ca5b08504eeba31b43cb7127f6", "ja": "ハグしていいですか！　いいですねっ！？", "zh": "可以抱抱吗！可以的吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
